### Authenticate Member
### Scopes: client allows "all" (API), "openid", "profile" (see IdentityServerConfig.GetClients)
POST {{baseUrl}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username=testMember@mail.com&password=testMemberPass&client_id=ro.client&client_secret=secret&scope=all%20openid%20profile

### Authenticate Admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&username=testAdmin@mail.com&password=testAdminPass&client_id=ro.client&client_secret=secret&scope=all%20openid%20profile


